oading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Emblem Purple.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Emblem_Purple.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/13/D012_Emblem_Purple.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209050509\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Idle Sky Pirate\"><img alt=\"Idle Sky Pirate\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">5\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Transient Gunner\"><img alt=\"Transient Gunner\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">6\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">7\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>On the world map head forward to a beachy area, there's a chest with 1000 gil on it. Beyond it is the next gateway but we're not ready, of course. Up head near a sealed gateway is a Skeleton Fragment, and on the island is a BRV Charge. The Fragment only unlocks a Level 30 weapon we can't use yet. If the orbs of the dead don't give you a Jump Chain or Multichain, go back to the moogle and get one for the blue gateway.\n</p><p>Use a Jump Chain right where you enter, or move to C2 and use a Multichain, to get four enemies. I prefer the Jump Chain, since if you need to buy the skill you're using it's cheaper, and the four enemies it chains includes the ones obstructing the chest. KP Chance is a 90 second victory, use that BRV Charge if you want the boost, I did. Notice though how with the BRV Charge, more than the EX or Assist Charge skills, make the KP Chance ridiculously easy to meet when it's a timed victory? \n</p><p>First, a Counterfeit Wraith, has a tentacle attack it didn't complete so I'm not sure which it was, and she also has those accessories again. Next, a Phantasmal Harlequin. It also has those boosters, both of Kefka's Firaga-type attacks, and a summonstone I didn't see him use. Third, Idle Sky Pirate, those accessories yet again, he's got the Crossbow attack on the ground and Shield &amp; Sword in the air, watch for blocks, and the HP attack Inferno. He also uses the Chocobo summon. Last, a Capricious Thief with the boosters, Scoop Art, Solution 9, and Tidal Flame for HP attack. The last enemy we didn't chain is a Transient Gunner with Missile Barrage and Satellite Laser, and of course he too has those accessories.\n</p><p>The chest has Oerba Beads. They can be traded for an Extension or a Chocobracelet.\n</p><p>Well we're done here obviously, on to the next gateway!\n</p>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden;float:left;margin:0 1px\"><div style=\"position:relative;left:-0px;margin-right:-30px;top:-10px;margin-bottom:-15px;;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/d/d0/Dissicon_ff6_Ter1.png/revision/latest?cb=20101120015142\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Dissicon ff6 Ter1\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dissicon ff6 Ter1.png\" data-image-key=\"Dissicon_ff6_Ter1.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/d/d0/Dissicon_ff6_Ter1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20101120015142\" /></a></span></div></div>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Imaginary Champion\"><img alt=\"Imaginary Champion\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">2\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"DFF Start\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Start.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Start.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/8/8f/D012_Emblem_Blue.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209004544\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Booster Accessory x5\"><img alt=\"Booster Accessory x5\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Emblem Blue.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Emblem_Blue.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/8/8f/D012_Emblem_Blue.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209004544\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Transient Gunner\"><img alt=\"Transient Gunner\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/4/44/DFF_Summonstone.png/revision/latest?cb=20100712153022\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Demon Wall [Auto]\"><img alt=\"Demon Wall [Auto]\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"38\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Summonstone.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Summonstone.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/4/44/DFF_Summonstone.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20100712153022\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">3\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/13/D012_Emblem_Purple.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209050509\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Initial BRV Boost\"><img alt=\"Initial BRV Boost\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Emblem Purple.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Emblem_Purple.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/13/D012_Emblem_Purple.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209050509\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">4\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234241\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Transient Gunner\"><img alt=\"Transient Gunner\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20110203234241\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Imaginary Soldier\"><img alt=\"Imaginary Soldier\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/6/6b/D012_Cosmos_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110325134317\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Terra Branford\"><img alt=\"Terra Branford\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Cosmos Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Cosmos_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/6/6b/D012_Cosmos_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20110325134317\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">5\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">6\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">7\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>As we enter we see a scene of the Cloud of Darkness preparing to attack our heroes, but Kefka wants to have some first. He sends the Cloud of Darkness off on an errand, muttering that she better do her job this time. Multichain at E3 to get all four, I used my Assist Charge here. Bonus line is 6 with a KP Chance of a 90 second win. Wall Rush the opponent with Onion's ground attack followed by the follow-up to slam them to the ground, then call Terra for Blizzara to pile on more damage, and depending on where the opponent is going to end up, use Comet or land and use Blade Torrent.\n</p><p>Opposition this time, an Imaginary Champion with those boosters again, the Hecatoncheir summon. and he uses Shadow Flare and Godspeed with the Black Materia HP attack. Black Materia has him hold still on the ground so call Terra to interrupt him, if he lets loose without charging he'll fire a meteor at you on a downward angle from above his head, if he fully charges though he'll summon a large meteor right over your head, tricky to dodge. Next is a Transient Gunner, he uses Ricochet Shot and Missile Barrage with Satellite Beam, but no Assist, summon or equipment saved for Cursed Rings, an easy kill. After him, a stronger Gunner, same attacks with a weapon, those booster accessories, and the Carbuncle summon. Finally an Imaginary Soldier, he has those accessories, the Magic Pot summon, and he uses Blade Beam and Slashing Blow. His HP attack is Meteorain, don't get stuck near a wall when it goes off. As there's a boss coming, try and charge up your EX Gauge in preparation.\n</p><p>The summonstone awaiting us when we crush them is Demon Wall. He appears automatically when our Bravery falls below half its base value, and will shield us from harm for a period of time, the opponent will still gain Bravery but we won't lose it. Pretty useless for this point with how aggressive enemies are (not). As we approach the end piece, Terra says they've reached the power source she sensed, when suddenly she begins to moan and clutch her head. Unfortunately Kefka's still got that Slave Crown...er, Puppeteer's Wheel, kicking around and begins attacking.\n</p><p>This fight is pretty much just like the fight you had against Terra back in Vaan's story, the only difference is that you're in a different arena, and due to the costume change her Esper form is in grape flavor instead of blueberry. She has that Puppeteer's Wheel keeping her in EX Mode for pretty much the entire fight, filling her EX Gauge with just a few motes of EX Force, but she also has a Cursed Ring, <i>of course</i>. She'll spam Tornado the entire fight, dual-casting it naturally since she's in EX Mode, but will never use her EX Burst. This is pretty simple, she only has the ground version of Tornado, so get close, but not too close. This will bait her into using Tornado, back off, wait for it to end, then fire off a spell or approach as she lands and hit her with a melee attack. Very easy, no danger at all here.\n</p><p>I naturally used Onion Knight's EX Mode here so let's cover that. His EX Mode transforms him into a Ninja and a Sage, he'll automatically shift into Ninja for physical attacks (including all Chase attacks), and into a Sage for magic. His EX Mode powers up his physical attacks to insane levels, doing twice as many hits. His spells change in slightly different ways, his Thunder fires out five orbs of lightning instead of three, all around him instead of just in front too, Blizzard fires further and thus can hit on a stronger angle, and Comet fires out more meteorites. Though he doesn't know it yet I'll note this so you know when the time comes, in his EX Mode his Firaga HP attack fires out three fireballs in a spread pattern instead of just one fireball straight ahead. He has two EX Bursts, depending on if it was a magic or physical attack that initiated it. For a physical, the Ninja uses Ninjutsu, and for a magical, he uses Spellbook. For Ninjutsu, you need to open the Throw menu and select the Shuriken. Spellbook, open the Magic menu and select Holy. The two EX Bursts have identical power, so there's no preference to either innately, it depends on if the opponent has equipment or accessories that reduces damage from one type and not the other.\n</p><p>With Terra tired after Onion's thrashing, she suddenly vanishes, teleported away by the Cloud of Darkness. The time has come to awaken Terra's true power, and all he did was help them, guiding her along with false wisdom even as she knew something wasn't right, then beating her into submission so they could kidnap her. The Cloud vanishes, leaving poor little Onion Knight alone.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rescue_Operation\">Rescue Operation</span><a title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Rescue Operation\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Walkthrough:Dissidia_012_Final_Fantasy/Drake/Part_11?action=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Rescue Operation\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>That fight with Terra has benefited us though, letting us Battlegen a Girl's Desire from her. Now we can finally trade for an Earring! With it, if you want you could take out the Hyper Ring for the Earring on Onion Knight, his physical attacks will be weaker but his magic will be stronger. I leave it to you to decide based on how you're using him. As a note the next parts of this walkthrough were done on a different day then previously, so no more AP bonus, aw.\n</p><p>Hidden behind the grass on the right is a BRV Zero. The moogle nearby has nothing worth buying. On the shoreline ahead is a Counterfeit Wraith, she uses Anti-Air Particle Beam but has no notable traits, no summon or Assist, etc. I Battlegen'd an Alarune Twig from her somehow, it unlocked only the Gaia Bell, useless. The nearby chest has 1000 gil. Up ahead break the rock and cross to the island for another 1000 gil. And now, the next gateway.\n</p>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234631\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"2000 gil\"><img alt=\"2000 gil\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Chest.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110203234631\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">2\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/8/8f/D012_Emblem_Blue.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209004544\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Magic Critical Rate Up\"><img alt=\"Magic Critical Rate Up\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Emblem Blue.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Emblem_Blue.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/8/8f/D012_Emblem_Blue.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209004544\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/1e/DFF_Expert_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110204003912\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Phantasmal Harlequin\"><img alt=\"Phantasmal Harlequin\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Expert Battle Piece.png\" dat